{"3660110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "血姬：双生 (Vampiress: Eternal Duet)", "steam_appid": 3660110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/22688352a76e96e74c5e6a363788c84f.avif?t=1765884745\" width=1530 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vampiress: Eternal Duet</strong> is a noir-style 3D side-scrolling action game where you play as a vampire lady, strategically switching between her vampiric and human forms. Engage in high-speed high-risk combat using blood as your ultimate resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find your long-lost sister, you must obey a mysterious broker and navigate a conflicted world. At the end of this bloody path lies your sister, a conspiracy, or... maybe hope?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“Pure Blood” Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Forms​</strong>​: Blood is power! The bloodthirsty <i>Scythe Form</i> consumes HP for swift kills, while the tactical <i>Cane Form</i> allows HP recovery and stun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus &amp; Skills​</strong>​: Unleash stylish yet practical attack skills to overwhelm enemies with relentless combo chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Foes​</strong>​: Enemies track you across terrain and will relentlessly pursue you once combat begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break &amp; Execute​</strong>​: Shatter enemy defenses through skill combos, then deliver instant-execution finishers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Blood-Tears&quot; Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While searching for your sister, you receive a message from an enigmatic broker. To uncover her whereabouts, you must accept broker's missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a modern world torn by human-demon race conflict, you – a vampire – confront brutal realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The broker, your sister, gangs... This isn't just about them.<br>This is also about you, and... yourself</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction to the protagonist's dual-form weapon</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blood sickle &lt;&lt;--&gt;&gt; Staff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In her human form, the vampire lady will gracefully strike her enemies with her cane weapon, dizzying them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/96c3c0986dfd5981fdda42413496df03.poster.avif?t=1765884745\" width=1170 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/96c3c0986dfd5981fdda42413496df03.webm?t=1765884745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/96c3c0986dfd5981fdda42413496df03.mp4?t=1765884745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist in the Blood Scythe form is covered with blood-red marks all over his body, making it more agile and light. This enables the vampire lady to slash at high speed even when holding a huge scythe, easily harvesting enemies. However, a certain price has to be paid...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Scythe Form significantly enhances the character's performance at the cost of consuming her own HP. Switching to the Cane Form to attack will restore her HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/df3b549e4abf50a4b2201dfdaf8776f9.poster.avif?t=1765884745\" width=1170 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/df3b549e4abf50a4b2201dfdaf8776f9.webm?t=1765884745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/df3b549e4abf50a4b2201dfdaf8776f9.mp4?t=1765884745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both forms have their own advantages and disadvantages. We kindly ask players to use them skillfully to defuse the crisis...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aether Frenzy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During combat, enemies may occasionally enter a Frenzied state. Frenzied enemies become more powerful and can unleash Frenzy Skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Execution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When different types of Aether Frenzy enemies use their Frenzy Skills, a flash will appear in their eyes. Hitting them with the corresponding weapon skill will put them in an [Execution-ready] state. Press Attack to automatically perform an execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/2b7cfb8cdbb79ef1c867fb8cc18e5565.poster.avif?t=1765884745\" width=1170 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/2b7cfb8cdbb79ef1c867fb8cc18e5565.webm?t=1765884745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/2b7cfb8cdbb79ef1c867fb8cc18e5565.mp4?t=1765884745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Learning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, unlock a wide variety of skill modules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660110/extras/701e6107c1fee8f5aba03a0987cb22ad.poster.avif?t=1765884745\" width=1170 height=624 ><sourc